<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- Matumbi Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">AGALATIA</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gal</para>
  <para style="toc2">Agalatia</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua ya Pauli kwa Agalatia</para>
  <para style="mt1">Agalatia</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua ya Pauli kwa Agalatia</para>
  <para style="imt">Kilongolyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu sa Agalatia saandikilwe na Pauli Ntumilwe (1:1). Ayi' nga balua yaandike Pauli kwa makanisa gagabile Galatia munsimu wa myaka ya 48 na 57 bu'ka po belekwa kwa Yesu Kilisitu. Kwaali' Agalatia baabile nga bandu babaatami munkoa wa Galatia wawaabile muutawala wa Kiroma. Asomi ba makowe ga Bibilia bembe ntu'pu' ukakape bu'kana na pandu paabile Pauli kaiandika balua yi', lakini bi'ngi' bakita yaandikilwe kumuyi wa Efeso au Kolinto.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pauli paandike balua yi' aali'ngage Akilisitu boti bababile mumakanisa ga Galatia, yani balu' babaabile Ayahudi na bangali Ayahudi. Balua yi' aandike kwo binia li'nga kugataukya mayi'gano ga ubu'su' gagaapalage Akilisitu babi'ngi'ye salya ya Kiyahudi yayaabile mulilagano lya Kwai'mbu' kati amuli ya ngama ya Imani, muno liyi'gano lyo inilwa (liku'mbi'). Nkati ya aumini ba Kikilisitu kwaabile na kipi'nga sa bandu baali'ndi'ndi'li aumini bangali Ayahudi bainilwe. Kai' bandu bo baatipekeseni bu'kana no yi'ki'tya utawala wa Pauli ntumilwe. Pauli aukengi utumilwe wake kwo awanikia yi'ngi' ya abali yake, na aaiyi'mi Injili kwo awanikia panga ngaukosopoli kisake wauwesa patikana kwa ndi'la ya imani kwa Yesu Kilisitu (2:16). Awu' nga wema wa Nnu'ngu' waulaya kwa bandu na wala ukosopoli uu'bi'lyali iyendo ya bandu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mutasali</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Pauli atumbwa mubalua yake kwa kwasalimia aumini ba makanisa ga Galatia <char style="ior">(<ref loc="GAL 1:1-5">1:1-5</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Pauli aawanikia pi'ngi' pamakowe gake gagabu'kana na mwene li'nga kwiyi'mya aki yake yo yi'gana no kong'ondelya panga apayite tama kwo bi'ngi'ya salya lakini aakombwilili <char style="ior">(<ref loc="GAL 1:6-2:21">1:6-2:21</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Aawanikia muno bu'kana lipala lya salya na ngu'ngu' muukosopoli <char style="ior">(<ref loc="GAL 3:-1-4">3-4</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Apiya pandu nsi'si' kwa awanikia no laya bu'kana na tama mumaisa manogau ga Kikilisitu <char style="ior">(<ref loc="GAL 5:1-6:10">5:1-6:10</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Pauli ayomolya balua yake kwo piya salamu na malu'bo ga kuundi'la kaaku'mbu'ki'ya panga galambuyilwa na Nnu'ngu' no pangilwa mundu ywaayambi' nga likowe lya ngama muno kulikoni salya na kanuni ya panja, mpwano wa yi'lu' yo inilwa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="GAL 6:11-18">6:11-18</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Balua yi' niandike nenga na Pauli nanibile nantumilwe, kwenda kwa amuli ya bandu au kwa makakala ga mundu lili, ila kwa Yesu Kilisitu na kwa Nnu'ngu' Tati' ywannyu'yite bu'ka kuuwi'li. <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />Nenga na aumini ayangu' boti bababile pamope na nenga pano, tunsalimia mwenga mwamubile mumakanisa ga kunkoa wa Galatia. <verse eid="GAL 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Tunnu'bya ngu'ngu' na amani bu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu' Tati' bitu, na kwa Bwana Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="GAL 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />Kilisitu aaipiyite mwene kwa kitumbu sa masambi gitu, bu'kana na mwapendi Nnu'ngu' na Tati' bitu, li'nga apate kutukosopolya bu'ka muulau wa dunia yi'no ya nambi'yambi'. <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />Nnu'ngu' akwi'yi'lwe milele na milele! Amina.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntu'pu' Abali yi'ngi' Inannoga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Nisangala panga, muyu'ngwiye kunneka Nnu'ngu' ywembe ywaankemite kwa ngu'ngu' ya Kilisitu, na mutumbwa bi'ngi'ya mayi'gano gi'mbi'ke. <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />Kakape panga ntu'pu' Abali yi'ngi' Inannoga, lakini kubile na bandu babannyelenganiya no pala kwialabiya Injili ya Kilisitu. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Lakini ata ikatei twenga au malaika ywabu'ka kunani mana aalike Injili yi'ngi' mbali' na yi'lu' yatumwalile twenga, bai mundu ywo apate lasi milele! <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Kati mu'lu' mwatwayomwike baya patumbu, na nambi'yambi' nendabaya kai', manaitei mundu ywoywoti alu'a kumwalya Injili yi'ngi' yangali landana na yi'lu' yamwaipokile, mundu ywo aapata lasi bu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="GAL 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Buli, mugania panga nipala yi'ki'ti'lwa na bandu? Lili, nenga nipala yi'ki'ti'lwa na Nnu'ngu'. Au mugania nipala kwapulaisa bandu? Mana ikapangage kanipala kwapulaisa bandu, nilu'e pangali na ntumisi wa Kilisitu.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli mwapatike nkemo wake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Mwaalongo bangu', nipala mutange panga yi'lu' Injili yanamwalile, yaabu'kineli na bandu. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Na kwenda Injili yo naapeyilwe na mundu au yi'ganilwa na mundu ywoywoti lili, ila Yesu Kilisitu mwene ngaywaniumukulile.<verse eid="GAL 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Mwenga muyu'wine bu'kana na maisa gangu' ga kwai'mbu', panaabile na dini ya Kiyahudi, na mwanaalitesike likanisa lya Nnu'ngu' kwa makakala no paya kulilangamisa. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />Na nenga naayendeli muno kamwa mimu ya Kiyahudi kulikoni bandu bi'ngi' baingi ba nng'elo wangu', kwa mwanjaa naabini muno kamwa mimu ya akinatati' bitu.<verse eid="GAL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Lakini Nnu'ngu' kwa ngu'ngu' yake, aanisawi nibile balo ata belekwa, nganikema nintumikiye. <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />Yaannogeleli kumumukwa Mwana wake kasangu', li'nga niale Abali yake Inannoga kwa bandu bangali Ayahudi. Na apo, naapalikeli mawaso ga mundu ywoywoti, <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />na wala nau'bwikeli wi'ti' yenda Yelusalemu kwa balu' atumilwe babaabile alongoi baa atumilwe. Naayi'i wi'ti' kunkoa wa Arabia, bu'kapo nganibuyangania kai' kukilambo sa Damasko. <verse eid="GAL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Bu'ka po pi'ta myaka itatu nganiu'bu'ka yenda Yelusalemu bonagana na Petili na naatami kasake kwa masu'ba ku'mi na tano. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Lakini nakummonali ntumilwe ywi'ngi' ila Yakobi, nnunawe Bwana Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Nilapa nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu' panga ganimwandikyanga kwenda ga ubu'su'li.<verse eid="GAL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Bu'kapo, nganiyenda kunkoa wa Silia na Kilikia. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Mumasu'ba galu' naabile natanganikwali kwa aumini ba makanisa ga Yudea. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Bembe sabaatangite nga si'lu' bai sabaayu'wine panga, “Mundu yu'lu' ywatutesage patumbu, nambi'yambi' aala bu'kana na imani yi'yi'lu'yi'lu' yaapalage kwilangamisa.” <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Bai, ngabankwi'ya Nnu'ngu' kwa kitumbu sangu'.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="s">Pauli na atumilwe bi'ngi'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Bu'ka po pi'ta myaka ku'mi na nne, nau'bwi'ke kai' yenda Yelusalemu pamope na Balanaba, nganintola na Tito kai'. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Naayi'i ku Yelusalemu kwa kitumbu sa maumukwo gaaniumukuli Nnu'ngu', li'nga nikaawanikiye kikolongosi pakisabe. Nganaawanikia yi'lu' Abali Inannoga yaniiala kwa bandu bangali Ayahudi. Naapangite nyo li'nga kasi yangu' yanaayomwike panga, na yi'lu' yaniipanga nambi'yambi', yaakane panga yaabule bai. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Tito ywaabile pamope na nenga aai Nyunani, lakini aali'ndi'ndilweli inilwa. <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />Baabile aumini bi'ngi' ba ubu'su' babaayingi kwa kwiiya, ngabapalage kumwina. Bandu bo bapalage pekeseni uulu witu watupeyilwe na Kilisitu Yesu, li'nga bapate kutuyi'ya muubanda wa salya ya Musa. <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />Twaayi'ki'tyanieli nabo ata pasene li'nga ukakape wa Injili uigale na mwenga masu'ba goti.<verse eid="GAL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Lakini kikolongosi balu' ba kanisa babaisimu muno bandu, baabile ntu'pu' likowe lyolyoti lyayambi' lya kuniyongeya. Na kakape baatiisimu muno, lakini kwangu' nenga alyo likowe lya ngamali, mwanjaa kwa Nnu'ngu' ntu'pu' ubauli. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Lakini kikolongosi bo baatangite panga, Nnu'ngu' anitumike niale Abali Inannoga kwa bandu bangali Ayahudi, kati mu'lu' mwaatumilwe Petili ala Abali yo kwa Ayahudi. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />Kwa mwanjaa yu'lu' ywaampangite Petili panga ntumilwe kwa Ayahudi nga ywoywoywo ywaanipangite nenga panga na ntumilwe wake kwa bandu bangali Ayahudi. <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Bai, Yakobi, Petili na Yoani, babaabonekine panga kikolongosi aku'lu' ba kanisa, pabakwipwi panga Nnu'ngu' ngaywaaniyalile yi'lu' ngu'ngu' ngabatukamwa luboko nenga na Balanaba kwo laya panga tubile kiselele. Kwa nyo, ngatuyi'ki'tyana panga twenga tuyende kwa bandu bangali Ayahudi na bembe kwa Ayahudi. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Lakini bandu bo baatulu'bite kili'be simo panga, katwaaku'mbu'kya aki'ba. Na likowe lyo kwa kakape, nendebinia muno kulipanga.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli ankalipya Petili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Lakini Petili paaikite Antiokia, lisu'ba limo naatikuntaukya mpu'la nnu'ngi' ya bandu kwa mwanjaa aatikosa. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Patumbu bi'ngi' ba bandu ba kipi'nga sa Yakobi pabaabile balo isa po, Petili aabile kalya pamope na bandu bangali Ayahudi. Lakini bu'ka po ika bo, aalekite mpamo lya pamope na bandu bangali Ayahudi, kwo yogopa kipi'nga sa bandu babakong'ondelya inilwa. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Na Ayahudi bi'ngi' ngabalu'mbana nakwe muunapiki waupangage Petili, ata Balanaba naywembe ngayingya muunapiki wo. <verse eid="GAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Bai paniibweni panga bakotali kwa ukakape mwaipalikwa Injili, nganimmakia Petili mpu'la nnu'ngi' ya bandu boti panga, “Pamope no panga wenga wa Nnyahudi, lakini ubi'ngi'yali mimu ya Kiyahudi! Tumbwe lelo walu'a wesa buli kwapangiya bandu bangali Ayahudi babi'ngi'ye mimu ya Kiyahudi?”<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayahudi na bangali Ayahudi bakosopolelwa kwa ndi'la ya kumwu'bi'lya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />Kakape twenga kwa kibelekwe situ, twa Ayahudi na kwenda twabandu bene sambi kati bandu bangali Ayahudi lili. <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />Lakini tutangite panga, mundu awesali balangilwa aki kwo koleya salya ya Musa, ila kwa ndi'la ya kumwu'bi'lya Kilisitu Yesu. Kwa nyo ata twenga twa Ayahudi tumwu'bi'lya Yesu Kilisitu li'nga kwa ndi'la yo, Nnu'ngu' atubalangili aki nnu'ngi' yake. <verse eid="GAL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Bai, mana katupala balangilwa aki mu Kilisitu, bi'ngi' batubaya panga twabene sambi kwa mwanjaa twikamwali salya ya Musa. Buli, likowe li' lilaya panga Kilisitu nga ywatupangiya tupange sambi? Lili, ata pasene! <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Lakini manaitei nenga kanisenga kai' si'lu' saniyomwike sengwana, bai apo nenga nikong'ondelya panga nikosite. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Kwo bu'kana na salya yo nenga niwile. Niwile musalya yo li'nga nipate lama kwa ndi'la ya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />Nibambilwe pamope na Kilisitu, wala nengali kai' ywanilama, ila Kilisitu nga ywalama nkati yangu'. Bwu'mi wanibile nawo nambi'yambi' wa muyi'ga, nilama kwa ndi'la ya kumwu'bi'lya Mwana wa Nnu'ngu', ywanipendile kwo piya bwu'mi wake kwa kitumbu sangu'. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Niikanali ngu'ngu' ya Nnu'ngu', kwa mwanjaa ikapangage aki kaipatikana kwa ndi'la ya salya, bai waa kwa Kilisitu kulu'e panga kili'beli.<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s">Imani na salya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Mwenga Mwaagalatia, mwaalalo! Mulogilwe na nyai? Abali bu'kana no bambilwa kwa Yesu Kilisitu munsalaba, yaawanilwe mpu'la nnu'ngi' ya minyo ginu. <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Nipala nitange likowe limo bu'ka kwinu. Buli, mwaapoki Loo ywa Nnu'ngu' kwa kitumbu so kamwa salya au kwa kugau'bi'lya galu' gamwaagayu'wine? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Buli, kwani mwenga mwaalalo kati nya? Mwatumbwi maisa ginu kwa makakala ga Loo Mpeleteu! Buli, mupala yomolya kwa makakala ginu mwabene? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Buli, makowe goti gagampatike mwenga, gaai gabule bai? Lili, iwesekanali. <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Buli, Nnu'ngu' ampei Loo wake no panga mangelongelo pakatikati yinu kwa kitumbu so kamwa salya lili ila kwa kitumbu sa kugau'bi'lya galu' gamwaagayu'wine?<verse eid="GAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Maandiko Mapeleteu gabaya nyinya, <char style="qt">“Bulaimu aamwu'bi'li Nnu'ngu', ngabalangilwa panga mundu mwene aki nnu'ngi' yake.”</char> <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />Tumbwe lelo, mutange panga bandu babamwu'bi'lya Yesu, abo kakape nga bana ba Bulaimu. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Maandiko Mapeleteu gaalondolilwe bu'ka kwai'mbu' panga bandu bangali Ayahudi baalu'a balangilwa aki nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu' kwa ndi'la ya imani yabe. Gaalongoli aalilwa kwa Bulaimu panga, <char style="qt">“Pi'tya kasako bandu ba mataipwa goti baalu'a yaliwa.”</char> <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Bai, balu' bababile na imani, bayaliwa pamope na Bulaimu mundu ywa imani.<verse eid="GAL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Lakini boti babau'bi'lya timisa gagabu'kana na Salya ya Musa bai bakosike lasi kwa Nnu'ngu', kwa mwanjaa Maandiko Mapeleteu gabaya, <char style="qt">“Mundu ywoywoti ywakana kamwa no timisa goti gagaandikilwe mukitabu sa Salya, akositelasi.”</char> <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Kwa nyo ilaya mpu'la panga, ntu'pu' mundu ywabalangilwa aki nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu' kwa ndi'la ya kwikamwa salya, kwa mwanjaa Maandiko Mapeleteu gabaya, <char style="qt">“Mwene aki aalama kwa ndi'la ya imani.”</char> <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Salya iu'bi'lyali imani, paali pake iu'bi'lya iyendo ya mundu yaipanga. Kati Maandiko Mapeleteu mwagabaya, <char style="qt">“Mundu ywapanga goti gagapalikwa na salya, aalu'a lama kwo kamwa salya yo.”</char><verse eid="GAL 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Kilisitu aatukosopoli bu'ka mulasi ya salya, kwo tola lasi yo kwa kitumbu situ. Kwa mwanjaa iandikilwe panga, <char style="qt">“Ywoywoti ywaabambilwa munsalaba, apatike lasi.”</char> <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Aatukosopoli li'nga panga balaka yaapeilwe Bulaimu ipate kwaikya bandu bangali Ayahudi kwa ndi'la ya Kilisitu Yesu, li'nga kwa imani tupate kumpokya yu'lu' Loo ywaatulagi Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Salya na lilagano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Mwaalongo bangu', nilu'a kumpeya lukongo lwalubu'kana na maisa gitu ga kila lisu'ba. Tubaye bandu abi'li' baabi'i mayi'ki'tyano kwa malagano nsi'si'. Malagano go pabagapangite, ntu'pu' mundu kai' nkati yabe ywaawesa kugati'kwana au yongekeya kili'be si'ngi' panani yake. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Bai, Bulaimu apeyilwe malagano ywembe pamope na mmelekwo wake. Maandiko gabayali, “Na lubelekwo lwake,” yani baingi, ila gabaya, <char style="qt">“Na mmelekwo wako,”</char> yani Kilisitu. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Kili'be sanilu'a baya nga si'no, panga Nnu'ngu' ayomwike panga lilagano kwa ndi'la ya aki. Na ayo salya yaapitike myaka 430 nsu'gu' yake, kwa nyo iwesali ti'kwana malagano au galambwa galu' gaalagi Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Kwa mwanjaa mana ulisi kaupatikana kwa salya, bai uu'bi'lyali kai' malagano. Lakini Nnu'ngu' kwa ngu'ngu' yake ampei Bulaimu ulisi kwa ndi'la ya malagano. <verse eid="GAL 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Tumbwe lelo kwa ki'li' kube na salya? Salya yaatiyongeyelwa kwa kitumbu so laya sambi ya bandu, mpaka paalu'a isa yu'lu' Mmelekwo wa Bulaimu, ywaatambulilwe muli'lu' lilagano. Salya yi' yaaletilwe na malaika kwa luboko lwa mwawanikiyi Musa. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Kwa nyo, mwawanikiyi apalikwa baa manaitei kubile na masikisano ga ku'no na ku'no, lakini Nnu'ngu' yumo bai, antumili mwawanikiyi paampei lilagano Bulaimu.<verse eid="GAL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kitumbu sa salya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Buli, salya yendataukana na malagano ga Nnu'ngu'? Ata pasene! Kwa mwanjaa mana salya yaipiyilwe iwesa kwapeya bandu ukoti, bai mundu alu'e wesa balangilwa aki nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu' kwa ndi'la yo kamwa salya. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Lakini nyoli. Maandiko Mapeleteu gabaya panga bandu boti batabilwe muutawala wa sambi. Kwa kitumbu so, bandu boti babamwu'bi'lya Yesu Kilisitu balu'a pokya lilagano li'lu' lya Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Kubile balo pitya nsimu wa imani, twaalongoyilwe na salya, kati twaatabilwa, katuli'nda mpaka imani yi'lu' iumukulilwe. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Salya yo yaabile kati nneli ywitu mpaka nsimu waaikite Kilisitu, li'nga kwa ndi'la ya imani tupate balangilwa aki nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Lakini nambi'yambi', imani mu Kilisitu Yesu iikite, kwa nyo tubileli kai' pai' ya salya, yayaabile kaitulela.<verse eid="GAL 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Kwa mwanjaa mwenga mwaboti mwabana ba Nnu'ngu' mu Kilisitu Yesu kwa ndi'la ya imani. <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />Mwanjaa mwaboti mwamubatisilwe no lu'mbana na Kilisitu, mubile kati mung'weti Kilisitu. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Kwa nyo, nkati ya Kilisitu kubileli na ubauli panga, wenga wa Nnyahudi au Nyunani, mundu mmanda au angwana, nnalu'me au nnwawa. Mwaboti mubile nsawani kwo lu'mbana na Kilisitu Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Mana itei mwenga nga mwabandu ba Kilisitu, bai mwenga nga mwalubelekwo lwa Bulaimu, na mwaalu'a pokya ulisi kati mu'lu' mwaalagi Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Bai, likowe lyanipala kummakia nga li'no, masu'ba goti mwana mana abile balo nnangu'ta apanga nnisi, lakini balekangineli na mmanda, pamope no panga ywembe nga mwene mali yoti. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />Wakati awo woti abile pai' ya aleli na ayi'mi'li'ki mpaka wike nsimu waubi'kilwe na tati' bake. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Na twenga nyinyonyo, Kilisitu paabile balo isa, twaabile kati twabana pai' ya utawala wa dunia. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Lakini nsimu waupalikwage pawikite, Nnu'ngu' ngantuma Mwana wake, ywaabelekwi na nnwawa no tama pai' ya salya, <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />apate kutukosopolya twenga twatwaabile pai' ya salya ya Musa, tupate pokya ulisi no pangilwa twabana ba Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="GAL 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Kwa mwanjaa mwenga nambi'yambi' mwabana ba Nnu'ngu', Nnu'ngu' antumike Loo wa Mwana wake mumyoyo yitu, ywakema “Abba” lombolya, “Tati'!” <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Bai, nambi'yambi' mwenga mwaabandali kai', ila mwabana ba Nnu'ngu'. Kwa nyo, manaitei mwenga mwabana bake, mwalu'a pokya ulisi wa Nnu'ngu', waabi'ki bana bake.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kyukala sa Pauli kwa Agalatia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Patumbu mwantangiteli Nnu'ngu', kwa nyo mwabile mwaabanda ba Nnu'ngu' ywa kakape lili. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Lakini kwa mwanjaa nambi'yambi' muntangite Nnu'ngu', au tubaye mutanganikwe na Nnu'ngu', muwesa buli kai' bukiya muutawala wa patumbu wa ukigopi na wangali pwaila? Au mupala mube mwaabanda babe kai'? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Balo kamwiku'mbu'kya si'li'ku'si'li'ku' ya Kiyahudi? Mugaisimu masu'ba, myei na myaka ya mimu ya api'ndo ba Kiyahudi. <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Niyogopa panga, kwaali' kasi yangu' yaniipangite kasinu iwesa panga yabule.<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Mwaalongo bangu', nendakunnu'banga muno panga mube kati nenga, kwa mwanjaa nenga nibile kati mwenga mwangali Ayahudi bu'kana na salya ya Musa. Mwaanipangili likowe lyolyoti lyakau. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Mutangite panga utamwe wanaabile nawo patumbu, ngawanipangite nipate lipala lya kumwalya Abali Inannoga. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Pamope no panga utamwe wangu' wannyingiye mumapayilwo, ata nyo mwaanisalawili wala kunisalanga, ila mwanikemi kati malaika ywa Nnu'ngu', kati mu'lu' mwamulu'e kumpokya Kilisitu Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Mwaabile na pulaa muno nsimu wu'lu', lakini nambi'yambi' pulaa yinu iyi'i kwaku'? Niwesa kong'ondelya panga, nsimu wu'lu' mulu'e wesa ata yokwa minyo ginu na kunipeya nenga. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Buli, nambi'yambi' nigalambwike no baa na nndumu winu kwa kitumbu sa kummakia ukakape? <verse eid="GAL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Abo bandu bi'ngi' bendakumwaukya muno mwenga, lakini mabinio gabe manogauli. Bapala mutalukane na nenga li'nga mwaauki bembe. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Kakape inogite kwaaukya bandu bi'ngi' mumakowe manogau, na kwenda panibaa pamope na mwenga baili. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Mwabana bangu' nimmi'kya lwu'ngu' kai' kwa kitumbu sinu kati mau' ywapapa. Nilu'a yendelya na lwu'ngu' lwo mpaka Kilisitu abonekane nkati yinu kwa galu' gamugapanga. <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />Nambi'yambi' niminyikia nikabaa pamope na mwenga, kwaali' nilu'e galambwa lilobe lyangu' kwa mwanjaa, nibile na kyukala kwa kitumbu sinu.<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukongo lwa Ajiri na Sara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Munibakiyange mwenga mwamupenda tawalilwa na salya, buli mutangite mwaibaya salya? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Kwa mwanjaa iandikilwe panga Bulaimu aabile na bana abi'li', yumo aai mwana ywa nnwawa mmanda ywakemelwage Ajiri, na ywene ibi'li' kwa nnyumbowe Sara, ywembe nga nnwawa ywaabile ulu. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Yu'lu' mwana ywa nnwawa mmanda aabelekwi bu'kana na mwabapendi bandu, lakini yu'lu' ywa nnwawa ulu ywembe aabelekwi bu'kana na lilagano lya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="GAL 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Makowe go gabile na kilombolyo si'ngi' kwinu mwenga. Kwa mwanjaa abo alwawa abi'li' nga lukongo lwa malagano gabi'li'. Lilagano lilongoi, nga li'lu' lya salya ya Musa lyalyaapangike mukitu'mbi' sa Sinai, lyalipapa bana abanda. Alyo nga aywo Ajiri. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Kwa nyo, Ajiri ayi'ma paali pa kitu'mbi' sa Sinai, sakibile Arabia, na nga lukongo lwa bandu ba Yelusalemu ya nambi'yambi', mwaibile muubanda pamope na bana bake. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Lakini Sara ayi'ma paali pa Yelusalemu ya kunani nga nni'ma ulu, na ywembe nga mau' bitu. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Kwa mwanjaa iandikilwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">
    <char style="qt">“Upulaike, wenga wa nnwawa waubile wantonga, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">
    <char style="qt">wu'bu'ye lilobe wenga wangali pata lwu'ngu' lwo papa mwana,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">
    <char style="qt">mwanjaa bana ba yu'lu' ywalekilwe, banambone, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">
    <char style="qt">kulikoni ba yu'lu' nnwawa ywabile na nsengowe.” </char><verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Bai, nambi'yambi' mwaalongo bangu', mwenga nga mwabana ba Nnu'ngu' bu'kana na lilagano lyake, kati mwabile Isaki. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Lakini kati mu'lu' mwayaabile masu'ba galu' kwa yu'lu' ywaabelekwi kimundu, ngantumbwa nnomo yu'lu' ywaabelekwi kwa uweso wa Loo Mpeleteu. Na ngamwaibile ata nambi'yambi'. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Lakini Maandiko Mapeleteu gabaya buli? <char style="qt">“Mummu'ye nnwawa mmanda pamope na mwana wake, kwa mwanjaa mwana wa nnwawa mmanda katu awesali lisi pamope na mwana ywa nnwawa nngwana.”</char> <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Kwa nyo, mwaalongo bangu', twenga kwenda twabana ba nnwawa mmandali, ila twabana ba nnwawa nngwana.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s">Muukote uulu winu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Kilisitu atupei uulu na apala tutame muulu wo, kwa nyo muyi'me kwo kangamala na kanemuyi'ki'ti ki'li'bu'ka muubanda wo. <verse eid="GAL 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Mupi'kaniange! Nenga na Pauli, nimmakianga panga, mana muyi'ki'ti inilwa, bai Kilisitu aapanga kili'be sa ngamali kasinu. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Nilongela mpu'la bai panga, kila ywayi'ki'tya inilwa apalikwa kwikoleya salya yoti. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Mana kamupala balangilwa aki nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu' kwa kwikoleya salya, mwapanga mwibi'kite kuutalu na Kilisitu, na kwiobeya ngu'ngu' ya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Lakini twenga tuli'nda kwo u'bi'lya kwa makakala ga Loo, tupangilwe twabene aki kwa ndi'la ya imani. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Kwa mwanjaa mana tulu'mbine na Kilisitu, inilwa au kotoka inilwa kupangali kili'be sosoti. Ila kili'be sa ngama nga imani yitu yaipanga kasi kwa upendo. <verse eid="GAL 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Patumbu mupangage kinannoga, nambi'yambi' nyai ywankanikia kugakamwa mayi'gano ga kakape? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Ywaampangite mube na ali yo, kwenda Nnu'ngu' ywankemangali. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />Mulinguli! “Ngelule njene ilu'ya linnyate lyoti lya bwembe!” <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Nibile na ukakape panga mulu'mbine na Bwana Yesu, kwa nyo, mwaabali na ndi'la yi'ngi' ya ubu'su'. Mundu mana aalu'a kunkonga aapwatilwa, ata akatei nyai. <verse eid="GAL 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Mwaalongo bangu', manaitei kakape niala panga analu'me boti bapalikwa inilwa kati mwababaya, kwa buli Ayahudi bendaniku'su'mbwa? Ikapangage kaniala nyo, ala kwangu' kwo bu'kana na kiwo sa Yesu munsalaba kulu'e kwapangali Ayahudi banisuki. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Naapendi bandu bo babamwauya kwa makowe go inilwa, bakaibu'ya bene mpamo kili'mbi'li'mbi' se. <verse eid="GAL 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Mwaalongo bangu', mwenga mwaakemilwe na Nnu'ngu' li'nga mube mwangwana, bai kanemuutumi ungwana wo kwa kugakoleya maminyikiyo ga yi'ga, ila muyangatiane kwa upendo. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Kwa mwanjaa, salya yoti iyomolelya muamuli yi' yimo, <char style="qt">“Umpende mundu ywapapipi yako kati mwawipenda wamwene.”</char> <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Lakini manaitei mwaalumiyana no taunana kati inyama ya mupu'ngu'ti', mwilole mwakane langamisana.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maisa ga kiloo na ga kidunia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Bai, iyendo yinu ilongoyelwe na Loo Mpeleteu, na mwenga mwalu'a kugakoleyali maminyikiyo ga yi'ga. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Kwa mwanjaa yi'ga iminyikiya galu' gagataukilwa na Loo, na Loo iminyikiya galu' gagataukilwa na yi'ga. Kwa kitumbu so mukombwali kugapanga gamugapala. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Lakini mana kamulongoyelwa na Loo Mpeleteu, mwaatamali kai' pai' ya salya. <verse eid="GAL 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Bai, iyendo ya kiyi'ga kwa mpu'la nga yi'no, upege, usapu, makowe goti ga oni, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />kilikitya inyago, bwabi', undumu, bulwe, bwigu, nyongo, bwimi, mitau, malekangano, <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />sukya, ubulagi, lobya, mila, na makowe gi'ngi' gagalandana na ago. Nendakunkwi'li'kanga kati mwanankwi'like patumbu panga, bandu babapanga makowe kati go baaulisili ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="GAL 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Lakini mauno go longoyelwa na Loo nga upendo, pulaa, amani, ukomeyi, unogau, unogamwoyo, u'bi'li'ka, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />tu'ya na kwikanikia. Ntu'pu' salya yaikanikia makowe kati ga. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Boti bababile ba Kilisitu baibambiye ali yabe ya dunia pamope na maminyikiyo gake maakau. <verse eid="GAL 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Kwa mwanjaa tutama kwa Loo, bai tulongoyelwe na Loo. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />Kanetwipune na kwilumba. Tupalikwali sokosana wala bi'kyana bwigu.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s">Tukomeyane no yangatiana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Mwaalongo bangu', mundu mana aponangine no panga sambi, bai mwenga mwamulongoyelwa na Loo Mpeleteu munkwi'li'ke mundu ywo kwo liya. Na kila mundu ailinguli aakane payilwa. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Muyangatiane mwabene na bene kwipu'twa igombo yinu, kwa ndi'la yi' mwapanga mwikamuliye salya ya Kilisitu. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Mana mundu ywoywoti kaibona panga ywa ngama na kumbe lili, aywo aikonga mwene. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Kila mundu aili'nge kasi yake mwene, na apo ngapaalu'a kombwa kwilumba pangali landanisa na mundu ywi'ngi'. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Kwa mwanjaa, twaboti tupalikwa timisa galu' gatupalikwa kugapanga. <verse eid="GAL 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Mundu ywayi'ganilwa Abali Inannoga, apalikwa kummaulya mwalimu wake ili'be yoti nogau yapata. <verse eid="GAL 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Kanemwikonge! Nnu'ngu' apangilwali nsalango, sosoti saapanda mundu nga saalu'a una. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Ywapanda mumaminyikiyo ga yi'ga yake, aauna maakau muyi'ga yake, lakini ywapanda mwapala Loo Mpeleteu, aauna ukoti wangayomoka bu'ka kwa Loo. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Bai, kanetutotokelwe kwo panga manogau, kwa mwanjaa mana twatombolokali, twauna mauno pansimu wake. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Kwa nyo patupata lipala, twaapangi manogau bandu boti, munomuno kwa balu' alongo babau'bi'lile.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mayi'gano ga kuundi'la na salamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Lolange, mwaniandike elupi ngu'lu' kwa luboko lwangu' namwene. <verse eid="GAL 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Balu' babapala bonekana anogau kwa makowe ga yi'ga, bapala banni'ndi'ndi'li inilwa. Lakini bapanga nyo kwa mwanjaa bakana ku'su'mbu'lwa kwa kitumbu so ala abali ya kiwo sa Kilisitu munsalaba. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Ata babainilwe bene baiyu'wali salya, ila bapala muinilwe li'nga bailumbe kwa abali ya inilwa kwa yi'ga yinu. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Nenga niilumbali kwa kitumbu sa makowe kati ga, ila nsalaba wa Bwana witu Yesu Kilisitu awo nga kitumbu sa kwilumba kwangu'. Bu'kana na kiwo sa Yesu munsalaba, dunia ngaiwaa kasangu', na nenga niiwi'li dunia. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Kwa mwanjaa, inilwa au kotoka inilwa kili'beli, ila kili'be sa ngama nga pangilwa wa wayambi' kwa Kilisitu. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Amani na kiya yaibu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu' ibe kwa bandu boti babaukoleya ukakape wo, na abo nga bandu ba Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="GAL 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Bai, bu'ka nambi'yambi' mundu kaneaniauye kai', kwa mwanjaa nenga nibile na mabai muyi'ga yangu' ganigapatike kwa kitumbu sa Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Mwaalongo bangu', ngu'ngu' ya Bwana witu Yesu Kilisitu ibe namwe. Amina.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>